Subject: [PATCH] Tests and documentation of the generic-parallel interface for
 behaviours

Behaviours generated with the generic and generic-parallel interfaces,
results compared on two time steps of a random loading: J2 plasticity,
implicit Norton, Hosford criterion, elastic properties given by a
material law. Configurations cuda-nvcc and stlpar-parunseq-gcc.
